Ordinance/ Amended/I(BD/ammreimbursement for the costs of clean up through reasonable collection efforts, including,but not limited to filing a lien on the owner's property. The City of Rector may alsochose to issue a citation for violation of this ordinance.Section 5: If the owner has not complied with this ordinance and notice hasbeen sufficiently met, a fine of ($ 100.00) is hereby imposed against the owner or ownersof any house, building and/or structure found declared to be in violation of this ordinance.The City of Rector shall also be entitled to all restitution for the costs of clean up asstated in Section 4.Section 6: If the owner/owners of the property do not comply with the courtorder, subsequent violations of this ordinance will result in a fine ranging from $200 to$500 and restitution associated with clean up costs.THEREFORE, an emergency is declared to exist and this Ordinance is necessaryfor the public peace, health and safety and this Ordinance shall be in full force and effectfrom and after its passage and approval.
